# Lopsy Photos on Cloudflare Pages (docs/photonamous-spec.md, 6.3).
# Paths are relative to the app: scripts/assemble-site.mjs moves them under
# /photos/ for lopsy.art; on its own domain they apply as written.
#
# - script-src: the engine needs 'wasm-unsafe-eval'; Google sign-in
#   (accounts.google.com/gsi) and the Picker's loader (apis.google.com).
# - connect-src: the Drive API and uploads, token revocation, the Picker's
#   API host, and Google sign-in.
# - frame-src: Google sign-in's iframes (accounts.google.com) and the
#   Picker dialog (docs.google.com, drive.google.com).
# - font-src: fonts the Picker's loader may add to the page.
# Checked on 2026-11-18 against the hosts gsi/client references and the
# CSP example in Google Workspace's drive-picker-element README
# (docs/photonamous-setup.md, section 3).
# - style-src 'unsafe-inline': the Google Picker and sign-in insert inline
#   styles into the page; the app itself uses only its stylesheet.
# - worker-src 'self': the offline shell's service worker (sw.js at the app's
#   base) and the engine's workers; manifest-src 'self': the web manifest.
# - No Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: it would cut the sign-in popup and the
#   Lopsy handoff off from their openers (6.4, 6.12).
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'wasm-unsafe-eval' https://accounts.google.com/gsi/ https://apis.google.com; connect-src 'self' https://www.googleapis.com https://oauth2.googleapis.com https://content.googleapis.com https://accounts.google.com; frame-src https://accounts.google.com https://docs.google.com https://drive.google.com; img-src 'self' blob: data: https://*.googleusercontent.com; worker-src 'self' blob:; manifest-src 'self'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://accounts.google.com/gsi/style; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'self'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/sw.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache
